Reduced motivation and drive should be rated on the basis of subjective reports and consequent  reduction in goal directed activity. ', N'0, 0   Nil (normal motivation) | 1, 1   Mild (slight reduction in motivation with no reduction in function) | 2, 2   Moderate (reduced motivation or drive with significantly reduced volitional activity or requires substantial effort to maintain usual level of function) | 3, 3   Severe (reduced motivation or drive such that goal directed behaviour or function is markedly reduced) | -99, -99 missing value', 0, 0, 1, 883, 0)

