Assess any reduction of social and interpersonal interaction the participant experiences due to  their avoidance or reluctance to engage in social contact. Rate in the context of what is normal for  the individual.  ', N'0, 0   Nil | 1, 1   Mild  (slight  reduction  in  social  engagement  with  no  impairment  in  social  or interpersonal function) | 2, 2   Moderate  (clear  reduction  in  social engagement with  some  functional  sequelae,  e.g., avoids some social engagements or conversations) | 3, 3   Severe  (marked  reduction  in  social  interaction  or  avoidance  of  almost  all  forms  of social contact, e.g., refuses to answer the phone or see friends or family) | -99, -99 missing value', 0, 0, 1, 881, 0)

