...How have (MANIC SXS) affected your work/

school?  (How about your attendance at work or school?  Did [MANIC SXS] make it more difficult to do your work/schoolwork?  How have [MANIC SXS] affected the quality of your work/

schoolwork?)



...How have (MANIC SXS) affected your ability to take care of things at home? 





NOTE: Code "3" if psychotic symptoms have been present.  You may need to return here to recode after screening for psychotic symptoms in Module B.', N'-99, -99 inadequate information | 1, 1 absent or false | 2, 2 subthreshold | 3, 3 threshold or true', 0, 0, 1, 162, 0)

