IF NECESSARY, RETURN TO THIS ITEM AFTER COMPLETING MODULES FOR OPTIONAL OC AND RELATED DISORDERS, SOMATIC SYMPTOM DISORDERS, AND TRAUMA- AND STRESS-RELATED DISORDERS.  ', N'-99, -99 inadequate information | 1, 1 absent or false | 3, 3 threshold or true', 0, 0, 1, 674, 0)

