NOTE: IF ANXIETY SYMPTOMS ARE CURRENT AND ARE TEMPORALLY ASSOCIATED WITH A PSYCHOSOCIAL STRESSOR, CONSIDER ADJUSTMENT DISORDER, PAGE L.20', N'1, 1 absent or false | 3, 3 threshold or true', 0, 0, 1, 637, 0)

