~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

...IF UNCLEAR: Did at least some of these symptoms like (SXS CODED "3") happen for more days than not over the (6 MONTH PERIOD OF ANXIETY AND WORRY)?', N'-99, -99 inadequate information | 1, 1 absent or false | 2, 2 subthreshold | 3, 3 threshold or true', 0, 0, 1, 631, 0)

