~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

...Has your drinking caused problems with other people, such as family members, friends, or people at work? (Have you found yourself regularly getting into arguments about what happens when you drink too much? Have you gotten into physical fights when you were drunk?)



...IF YES: Have you kept on drinking anyway?', N'-99, -99 inadequate information | 1, 1 absent or false | 2, 2 subthreshold | 3, 3 threshold or true', 0, 0, 1, 468, 0)

