~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

...Have you had a strong desire or urge to drink in between those times when you were drinking? (Has there been a time when you had such strong urges to have a drink that you had trouble thinking about anything else?)



...IF NO: How about having a strong desire or urge to drink when you were around bars or around people with whom you go drinking?', N'-99, -99 inadequate information | 1, 1 absent or false | 2, 2 subthreshold | 3, 3 threshold or true', 0, 0, 1, 466, 0)

