...IF YES: How long did that concern or worry last? (Did it last at least a month? Nearly every day?)', N'-99, -99 inadequate information | 1, 1 absent or false | 2, 2 subthreshold | 3, 3 threshold or true', 0, 0, 1, 522, 0)

